    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Suppressive Fire",
          "desc": "Every 5 Basic Attacks or the first Basic Attack after using a skill gains a piercing effect and deals continuous damage."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Blowfish Grenade",
          "desc": "Throws a bomb at the target area, dealing damage and slowing all enemies hit."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Shark Cannon",
          "desc": "Launches a rocket in the target direction, knocking back enemies in close range and dealing damage. Deals damage to enemies in range upon exploding on enemy heroes."
        },
        {
          "type": "Ultimate",
          "name": "Air Support",
          "desc": "Bombards the target location, slowing and dealing damage to enemies while gaining vision of the area."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "pros": [
          "Melts through tanks",
          "Insane late game scaling",
          "Strong damage pattern with Passive"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "No Mobility",
          "Weak early game",
          "Vulnerable to assassins"
        ],
        "gameplay_tips": "## Early Game\nFocus on farming and last-hitting minions whenever possible. Use Blowfish Grenade Skill 1 to poke enemies, which also gives you an empowered auto attack to increase your damage potential. Try to save Skill 2 for when you get ganked and jumped on to push enemies away.\n\n## Teamfights\nPrepare your passive before a fight by just auto-attacking or hitting nearby minions or monsters. Stand behind your front line and hit the closest target. Don't walk too far forward as you have no mobility to escape.\n\n## Tips & Tricks\nYou can auto-attack nothing to stack Luban No.7's passive, so when you get to lane or a fight, your passive will be available straight away\nSkill 2 Shark Cannon is a global skill that can be used for vision or to poke/snipe enemy heroes\nAlways auto attack between skills for maximum damage output. Never use 2 skills one after the other"
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "1) Semua skill Luban bisa dihindarin tinggal gerak. 2) Jangan adu di bawah \"bantuan udara\" kecuali HP cukup. 3) Pas sekarat waspadain meriam mulut hiu dari ult Luban. 4) Assassin cari momen masuk."
    },
    {
